config TINYML_APP_IC
	bool "Image classification (96x96 RGB)"
	help
	  Classify a 96x96 RGB image embedded in the firmware with a
	  convolutional classifier.  RGB [0,1] normalization is done in plain C
	  (ic_normalize.c); the model runs on the shared ts_realtek engine.
